WEBVTT

00:00:03.204 --> 00:00:06.621
Open a customer with an account, such as Jamie Chen.

00:00:06.621 --> 00:00:10.805
Store credit is money the store owes a customer, such as a refund

00:00:10.805 --> 00:00:12.278
you give as credit.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.224
It pays toward their next orders, after tax.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:20.573
Under Store credit, enter an Amount, check the Currency, and give a Reason,

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:22.264
such as Late delivery.

00:00:22.264 --> 00:00:23.412
Click Change.

00:00:23.863 --> 00:00:28.518
The balance updates, and the latest changes are listed with when, what, the

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:30.701
change and the balance after it.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:33.115
A negative amount takes credit away.

00:00:33.115 --> 00:00:37.253
A guest cannot have credit, because it is spent when they sign in.

00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:40.284
Loyalty points work the same way.

00:00:40.284 --> 00:00:45.398
Under Rewards, enter the Points to give, and a Reason, and click Change.

00:00:45.398 --> 00:00:49.267
The section shows the points and what they are worth.

